Description: High-performance estimation of Censored Quadratic Almost Ideal Demand Systems (QUAIDS)
    with Ray (1983) demographic scaling and Shonkwiler-Yen (1999) two-step censoring correction,
    powered by the 'pyquaidsce' backend via 'reticulate'. Supports Iterated Feasible Generalized
    Nonlinear Least Squares (IFGNLS), custom selection equations, internal IV expenditure control functions,
    and fast multi-core bootstrap standard errors.
